{"id": "Dc6dINIT27E", "title": "Video by tessa.fairbrook", "description": "Claude can now fix your prompts before answering.\n\nIt's called Prompt Master, 11,000 stars on GitHub, completely free. And it fixes the one problem every Claude user has.\n\nYou type a rough prompt, Claude does exactly what you typed, and you burn three messages explaining what you actually meant. That's where your tokens vanish.\n\nPrompt Master flips it. You write one messy sentence, and it hands back a finished prompt telling Claude what to output, what files to touch, and when to stop.\n\nSetup takes a minute. Download the repo, go to Claude, then Customize, then Skills, upload, done.\n\nIt runs your prompt through 35 credit-wasting patterns and remembers what you've already decided, so Claude doesn't forget it mid-chat. Same work, way fewer attempts. And it works on ChatGPT and Cursor too.\n\nThis is Claude doing something most people didn't know it could do.\n\nComment PROMPT and I'll DM you the full skill and setup.\n .\n .\n .\n .\n [ClaudeAI, ClaudeSkills, PromptMaster, PromptEngineering, AITools, ClaudeCode, TokenSavings, StayingAhead]", "channel": "tessa.fairbrook", "uploader_id": "29378333751", "uploader": "Tessa Fairbrook", "timestamp": 1788627910, "like_count": 571, "comment_count": 837, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2514109029063582a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.649, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.flis9-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMmgvNvFh_cWxAyKKKmY_Y8nV6yFqmtByyYgnxDYPalIHKdE8566Gput1RkNeGdN5SkdH82RBmrhpRDXK4EeiGtPIBS1Wqw8Mo8WFY.mp4?_nc_cat=1